From Prompt to Model Input
The full prompt is then sent to a serving framework in a format such as JavaScript Object Notation (JSON) to generate a response:
{
"messages": [
{"role": "system", "content": "...Hermes Agent instructions..."},
{"role": "user", "content": "What is a prompt?"}
],
"tools": [
{"name": "web_search", "description": "Search the web", ...}
],
...
}
